Installed-Size: 204
Description: Common CA certificates (Mozilla bundle of 2026-10-20)
 The certificate authorities shipped with Mozilla's browser, as extracted by curl
 (https://curl.se/ca/cacert-2026-10-20.pem), for OpenSSL, GnuTLS, curl and apt.
 .
 Replaces Procursus's 20240604 bundle, which still trusts emSign ECC Root CA - G3
 and Comodo AAA Services root, the roots behind the eMudhra intermediates whose
 private keys were recovered in October 2026. Mozilla removed both from its store.
 Same files and paths as the Procursus package; a later Procursus bundle replaces it.
